---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    Start([vigilo run results])

    RunId{Run id valid?}
    LoadRun[Load run]
    Found{Run exists?}
    Summary[Batch summaries by database; merge progress and scorecard in shard order]
    Payload[Build summary-only payload]

    Success([Success response])

    RunIdFail([Run id error])
    NotFoundFail([Run not found error])
    SummaryFail([Summary lookup error])
    OutputFail([Output write error])

    Start --> RunId

    RunId -- No --> RunIdFail
    RunId -- Yes --> LoadRun

    LoadRun --> Found
    LoadRun -. Lookup fails .-> NotFoundFail

    Found -- No --> NotFoundFail
    Found -- Yes --> Summary

    Summary --> Payload
    Summary -. Lookup fails .-> SummaryFail

    Payload --> Success
    Payload -. Write fails .-> OutputFail

    class Start command
    class Success success
    class RunId,LoadRun,Found,Summary,Payload system
    class RunIdFail,NotFoundFail,SummaryFail,OutputFail error
